Mark 16:1 , An Angel declares the resurrection of Christ to three women;
Mark 16:9 , Christ himself appears to Mary Magdalene;
Mark 16:12 , to two going into the country;
Mark 16:14 , then to the apostles;
Mark 16:15 , whom he sends forth to preach the gospel;
Mark 16:19 , and ascends into heaven.
